node=3D"21,1,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"21,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Ne=
ed it for one specific bulk-upload method?</b> Use <code data-path-to-node=
=3D"21,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"49">session.setJdbcBatchSize()</code> ins=
ide that method.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"21,2,0"><b data-path-t=
o-node=3D"21,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Need it for a completely separat=
e high-volume microservice/module?</b> Use a separate Persistence Unit.</p>=
</li></ul><p data-path-to-node=3D"22"><b data-path-to-node=3D"22" data-inde=
x-in-node=3D"0">Would you like to see how to properly configure <code data-=
path-to-node=3D"22" data-index-in-node=3D"48">GenerationType.SEQUENCE</code=
> so that your batching actually works?</b> (Remember, <code data-path-to-n=
ode=3D"22" data-index-in-node=3D"121">IDENTITY</code> will break all of thi=
s!)</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container>=
