 ideally set your <code data-path-to-node=3D"5" data-index-in-node=3D"81">a=
llocationSize</code> to match.</p><ul data-path-to-node=3D"6"><li><p data-p=
ath-to-node=3D"6,0,0">Hibernate will "reserve" 50 IDs from the database in =
one call.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"6,1,0">It then assigns them t=
o your entities in memory.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"6,2,0">Final=
