o-node=3D"9,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"83">entityManager.flush()</code> and=
 <code data-path-to-node=3D"9,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"109">entityManager=
.clear()</code> periodically to prevent your RAM from filling up with manag=
ed entities.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node=3D"10"><b data-path-to-node=
