nsfer</b> problem.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"1">Your proposed solution (qu=
erying for "moved" flags during load) is a bit risky because it creates a "=
fragmented" state. If you have to query multiple tables and manually merge =
lists in Java every time you load a Troop, your logic will become very brit=
tle, and performance will drop as your data grows.</p><p data-path-to-node=
