 count," treat each physical piece (or batch) as an entity with a <b data-p=
ath-to-node=3D"5" data-index-in-node=3D"117">Foreign Key</b> to the <code d=
ata-path-to-node=3D"5" data-index-in-node=3D"136">Troop</code>.</p><h3 data=
-path-to-node=3D"6">1. Entity Structure</h3><p data-path-to-node=3D"7">Keep=
 the relationship simple: A <code data-path-to-node=3D"7" data-index-in-nod=
e=3D"32">Furniture</code> belongs to exactly one <code data-path-to-node=3D=
"7" data-index-in-node=3D"65">Troop</code> at any given time.</p><response-=
